# Install saved-map zones (no-go and slow) on the robot as Nav2 keepout and speed filter masks.
# The ack is this response: success means both masks were built, persisted, and published
# as one revision. It does not mean Nav2 costmaps have already consumed them.
# Export JSON, schema_version 1, as produced by the dashboard's zones export.
string zones_json
---
bool success
string message
# Fingerprint and revision now active; on failure these still report the previously active ones (empty / 0 if none).
string applied_fingerprint
uint32 applied_revision
